W . . . . . . S . . . . . . S . . . . W
W . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . W
W W W W W W W W W W W W W W W W W W W W

PLACE light flicker pochodnia 1.5 0.7 1.5 radius=3 level=0.5 speed=8 min=0.3

PLACE enemy_type straznik 0 0 0 hp=50 speed=0.9 damage=10 sight=5 behavior=ambush
PLACE enemy_type upior 0 0 0 hp=60 speed=0.8 damage=6 sight=14 behavior=guard weapon=ognista_kula keep=3 windup=0.45 atlas=assets/sprites/upior.png scale=0.8 z=-0.05
PLACE enemy straznik s1 10.5 0 1.5
PLACE enemy straznik s2 10.5 0 5.5
PLACE enemy upior u1 17.5 0 3.5

PLACE item belty b1 4.5 0 5.5 ammo=belty amount=6 scale=0.45

